{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is based on a third-person shooter, but shooting is part of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When I was a kid, my favorite games were hide and seek and tag. I tried to implement these games from my childhood into a game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The difficulty of this game depends on your play style. Although it is a shooter, the goal is not to kill enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The bigger goal is to outwit or tease enemies in a cool way. You can use various traps, or you can choose to escape from enemy sight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is up to you to choose which method you want. It is almost impossible to kill enemies. Killing enemies is not the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a game that reminds you of hide and seek from your childhood. Try different game styles.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585150?t=1745260281","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585150/d3509f8b0b2710fe410d400744092482f7cce332/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745260281","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585150/d02f3ad3f6bbef5d9308ddafc13f437ba435b87e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745260281","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585150/d02f3ad3f6bbef5d9308ddafc13f437ba435b87e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745260281","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,4,5],"notes":"Just nudity. No sex. No self-harm, no drugs."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is based on a third-person shooter, but shooting is part of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When I was a kid, my favorite games were hide and seek and tag. I tried to implement these games from my childhood into a game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The difficulty of this game depends on your play style. Although it is a shooter, the goal is not to kill enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The bigger goal is to outwit or tease enemies in a cool way. You can use various traps, or you can choose to escape from enemy sight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is up to you to choose which method you want. It is almost impossible to kill enemies. Killing enemies is not the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a game that reminds you of hide and seek from your childhood. Try different game styles.</p>","developers":["No Brain"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585150/043d7a2b266a835220e07eda5ae1e700e243bae8/header.jpg?t=1745260281","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128195,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128195/movie480.mp4?t=1745113097","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128195/movie_max.mp4?t=1745113097"},"name":"trailer5","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128195/bd89b84411d0c370b3a4421fbd0260ce46e8f9e2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745113097","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128195/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745113097","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128195/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745113097"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257116172,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116172/movie480.mp4?t=1745113099","max":"http://video.akamai.stea